deepseek-harness-session provenance and attribution
====================================================

The c-shared plugin ABI definitions, initialization bridge, envelope types,
and allocation/free helpers in this repository are derived from the
CLIProxyAPI Go plugin examples maintained by Router-For.ME and Luis Pater:

- https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/blob/78f0c4079e3e6273d65d03b5549cffc898703264/examples/plugin/host-callback/go/main.go
- https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/commit/0ed85bb88b0b4b4d8538c2fbed067cfec7c7512c
