Those portions are used under the MIT License. Their copyright notices are
preserved verbatim in LICENSE.

The DeepSeek Harness session-header mapping was authored by ahoo and first
published as source in the legacy repository at:

- https://github.com/ahoo/cliproxy-plugins/commit/3192d9a378149845931d9166eab7df237c4d19a6
- main.go blob d29830b94bc4d8d332f2a42af1396ef6c7af8e34

This dedicated repository preserves the complete four-commit legacy history
on its main branch. The historical v0.1.0 and v0.1.1 tags remain only in the
legacy repository and are intentionally not recreated here: both pointed to
the initial registry-only commit, and their generated source archives did not
contain the plugin source. Version v0.1.2 is the first clean, source-bearing,
reproducible release from this dedicated repository.
